# NOTE: Content now lives server-side in Supabase (content_sections table),
# gated by Row-Level Security and fetched at runtime after login. The old
# client-side encrypted bundle (src/data/__payload.js) has been retired, so no
# plan content ships in the deploy. The plaintext (content-source/) and all
# secrets (.password.json, .scan-secrets.json, .env) are never committed.
